            <key>WFWorkflowActionParameters</key>
            <dict>
                <key>WFCommentActionText</key>
                <string>Shortcuts generated by Shortcuts Playground. May contain mistakes. Always check the shortcut's actions first.

This shortcut was created via the following user prompt:

&gt; Build TWO iOS Shortcuts (A/B test variants) for a Polish voice-note capture pipeline. Variant 1 "Transkryba Groq": config Dictionary with GROQ_API_KEY and NOTES_FOLDER, Record Audio, transcribe via Groq Whisper large v3 multipart upload, generate a Polish title with llama-3.3-70b-versatile, format the current date in day.month.year hour:minute form, and create an Apple Note in the configured folder. Show an alert and stop when the transcript is empty.</string>
            </dict>
        </dict>
